1
00:00:00,846 --> 00:00:02,180
Hey, so, where's Anzu?

2
00:00:02,264 --> 00:00:03,098
#12 LAST STORY!?

3
00:00:03,181 --> 00:00:05,183
She should have been
out here by now.

4
00:00:05,684 --> 00:00:09,271
Huh. I think she was in the break room
last time I saw her.

5
00:00:12,274 --> 00:00:13,358
What was that?

6
00:00:13,859 --> 00:00:16,445
My head hurts. It feels…

7
00:00:19,197 --> 00:00:20,240
Blood?

8
00:00:22,826 --> 00:00:24,619
I gotta get out of here.

9
00:00:24,703 --> 00:00:26,705
You're just like all the others…

10
00:00:28,165 --> 00:00:30,834
always in my way.

11
00:00:33,587 --> 00:00:34,755
Stop!

12
00:00:35,422 --> 00:00:36,798
You're not going alone.

13
00:00:37,674 --> 00:00:39,676
We should split up.
We'll cover more ground.

14
00:00:39,760 --> 00:00:40,844
-Mm-hm.
-Yes.

15
00:00:41,344 --> 00:00:43,138
Mr. Hijiri,
allow me to handle this.

16
00:00:43,221 --> 00:00:45,015
You should remain at work.

17
00:00:52,856 --> 00:00:54,608
What did you do, Anzu?

18
00:00:55,233 --> 00:00:58,320
Without my magic, I'm useless to you.

19
00:01:08,121 --> 00:01:09,164
Hoshino!

20
00:01:10,749 --> 00:01:12,751
You came for me, my love.

21
00:01:15,087 --> 00:01:16,088
Here.

22
00:01:20,592 --> 00:01:21,718
Hm.

23
00:01:22,803 --> 00:01:24,221
Tsukasa…

24
00:01:27,808 --> 00:01:29,935
I understand. Everyone else is in the way.

25
00:01:31,269 --> 00:01:33,355
None of this is any of your fault.

26
00:01:35,190 --> 00:01:38,527
I would have believed you
even when nobody else did.

27
00:01:40,320 --> 00:01:42,823
How dare you! Get away from Hoshino!

28
00:01:46,827 --> 00:01:50,122
Tsukasa? But why, my love?

29
00:01:50,205 --> 00:01:52,833
Sh-- Shut up! I am not your love!

30
00:01:52,916 --> 00:01:56,419
Everything you put me through!
And now you go after her!

31
00:01:56,920 --> 00:02:01,007
I never wanna see your face
or hear your voice ever again!

32
00:02:01,091 --> 00:02:02,300
Do you understand me?

33
00:02:02,926 --> 00:02:04,719
Get out of my sight!

34
00:02:06,054 --> 00:02:07,764
There's no need
for such silly lies.

35
00:02:09,641 --> 00:02:10,892
I understand.

36
00:02:11,476 --> 00:02:14,104
No one else will understand you like I do.

37
00:02:14,688 --> 00:02:18,525
My sweet Tsukasa,
I'll love you every minute of every day

38
00:02:18,608 --> 00:02:20,110
for the rest of my life.

39
00:02:21,236 --> 00:02:25,073
The sweet boy I know
wouldn't resort to this kind of violence.

40
00:02:25,157 --> 00:02:27,075
I see now. I need to stay by your side.

41
00:02:27,159 --> 00:02:29,703
You have some bad influences.

42
00:02:31,037 --> 00:02:32,122
Hmm?

43
00:02:32,205 --> 00:02:36,668
We make this perfectly clear.
If you keep trying to get to Kazuki,

44
00:02:37,294 --> 00:02:39,337
you're gonna have to go through me first,

45
00:02:40,005 --> 00:02:42,591
because I will always be right here
by his side!

46
00:02:43,091 --> 00:02:46,428
I will never let you get near him,
no matter what!

47
00:02:53,101 --> 00:02:54,561
Are you the one who called?

48
00:02:54,644 --> 00:02:57,230
Yes! That woman is armed
and is extremely dangerous!

49
00:02:57,314 --> 00:03:00,066
-Call it in! We need an…
-Hey, hey! Hold on!

50
00:03:02,485 --> 00:03:05,447
TRAFFIC SAFETY PROGRAM NOW ENFORCED

51
00:03:06,698 --> 00:03:08,491
You're okay.

52
00:03:09,534 --> 00:03:12,537
Hey, guys!
You didn't all need to wait for me.

53
00:03:13,496 --> 00:03:15,457
Anzu, are you all right?

54
00:03:15,540 --> 00:03:18,460
Yeah, turns out
it was just a little scratch.

55
00:03:18,543 --> 00:03:20,378
-Mm. That's a relief.
-That's a relief.

56
00:03:21,379 --> 00:03:22,464
Tsukasa.

57
00:03:23,882 --> 00:03:26,843
Dad, Mom.

58
00:03:30,805 --> 00:03:32,515
Are you Anzu Hoshino?

59
00:03:33,141 --> 00:03:34,184
Yes.

60
00:03:34,267 --> 00:03:37,520
It's my son's fault.
I'm sorry you were involved.

61
00:03:37,604 --> 00:03:39,648
Please accept our sincerest apology.

62
00:03:47,155 --> 00:03:49,574
Ow, uh…

63
00:03:50,242 --> 00:03:52,410
We're all truly sorry.

64
00:03:54,287 --> 00:03:56,331
I understand your parents are out of town.

65
00:03:56,831 --> 00:04:00,252
I would like to apologize
to them as well when they return.

66
00:04:01,127 --> 00:04:03,046
For now, you'll have to excuse us.

67
00:04:04,923 --> 00:04:07,217
We're leaving.

68
00:04:07,300 --> 00:04:08,885
Huh? Uh…

69
00:04:13,682 --> 00:04:15,433
Let's go home, Kazuki.

70
00:04:19,813 --> 00:04:20,939
Hey!

71
00:04:23,441 --> 00:04:25,318
Tsukasa needed your support tonight.

72
00:04:25,819 --> 00:04:28,321
But just like before,
you blamed him for everything.

73
00:04:28,822 --> 00:04:30,615
Do you know how hurtful that is?

74
00:04:31,616 --> 00:04:32,784
Aren't you his father?

75
00:04:32,867 --> 00:04:35,203
Of all people, I'd think
you would be the one stepping up

76
00:04:35,287 --> 00:04:36,371
to protect him!

77
00:04:37,122 --> 00:04:38,415
Let's go.

78
00:04:41,710 --> 00:04:43,628
She's right. We should go.

79
00:04:43,712 --> 00:04:45,547
How dare she.

80
00:04:45,630 --> 00:04:47,465
Such disrespectful behavior!

81
00:04:50,093 --> 00:04:51,177
Stop laughing!

82
00:04:51,261 --> 00:04:52,595
Mm, uh…

83
00:04:54,848 --> 00:04:56,975
I told you, Mom, I'm totally fine.

84
00:04:57,809 --> 00:05:00,979
But I can use more cute pics of Momohiki.
Good night.

85
00:05:04,024 --> 00:05:05,984
Mm. So, guess what?

86
00:05:06,067 --> 00:05:08,570
My mom's coming back home.
I tried to tell her

87
00:05:08,653 --> 00:05:11,364
there was nothing to worry about,
but she insisted.

88
00:05:11,448 --> 00:05:12,365
I'm sorry.

89
00:05:16,036 --> 00:05:19,289
Hey, Hoshino, how is it
that you were always saving me?

90
00:05:19,914 --> 00:05:21,624
Huh, I am?

91
00:05:21,708 --> 00:05:22,876
You are.

92
00:05:31,426 --> 00:05:33,345
Hey, Tsukasa, how you've been?

93
00:05:33,428 --> 00:05:35,263
Did you hear about
the junior high reunion?

94
00:05:35,347 --> 00:05:38,099
You'd better come.
It's been way too long, I miss you.

95
00:05:38,183 --> 00:05:40,518
Where you've been lately?
I miss you.

96
00:05:40,602 --> 00:05:41,978
So, got a girlfriend yet?

97
00:05:42,062 --> 00:05:43,146
Tsukasa, it's me.

98
00:05:51,654 --> 00:05:52,572
-Ah…
-Oh…

99
00:05:55,492 --> 00:05:58,203
I'm so sorry!

100
00:05:58,995 --> 00:06:01,998
That's a pretty good crack.

101
00:06:02,540 --> 00:06:05,502
I'm so sorry.
Please, let me pay to fix it.

102
00:06:05,585 --> 00:06:07,754
You don't have to pay
for the repairs.

103
00:06:08,588 --> 00:06:11,716
Well, then, thanks. Thanks a lot!

104
00:06:12,300 --> 00:06:15,178
I'm sorry, uh, I bumped you! Goodbye!

105
00:06:17,013 --> 00:06:17,889
Uh…

106
00:06:26,481 --> 00:06:27,524
Huh?

107
00:06:34,322 --> 00:06:36,116
Uh, hey, are you okay?

108
00:06:36,950 --> 00:06:38,910
Come on, don't just stand there,

109
00:06:38,993 --> 00:06:42,664
-help her up!
-All good! I'm totally fine!

110
00:06:44,916 --> 00:06:46,209
One set A.

111
00:06:46,292 --> 00:06:47,544
-Huh?
-Um…

112
00:06:55,218 --> 00:06:56,302
Hey.

113
00:06:57,053 --> 00:06:59,889
I get the feeling
she's gonna be just fine.

114
00:07:02,392 --> 00:07:04,811
SHUKAN HIGH INDUCTION CEREMONY

115
00:07:04,894 --> 00:07:06,896
Hey! Better hurry, Kazuki's leaving.

116
00:07:06,980 --> 00:07:09,816
He's too fast. I gotta catch up with him!

117
00:07:09,899 --> 00:07:11,901
I'd better go straight home.

118
00:07:14,404 --> 00:07:15,989
-Kazuki!
-Please just stop.

119
00:07:16,072 --> 00:07:17,323
Leave me alone.

120
00:07:18,616 --> 00:07:20,201
Whoa! Sorry!

121
00:07:20,285 --> 00:07:21,953
-Huh?
-Oh hey, watch out.

122
00:07:22,036 --> 00:07:24,789
-My bad, sorry! In a hurry!
-Uh?

123
00:07:26,749 --> 00:07:30,170
Hey, Kazuki!

124
00:07:31,212 --> 00:07:33,548
From the first time
you caught my eye…

125
00:07:35,758 --> 00:07:39,053
Out of respect for my friend,
I can't help.

126
00:07:39,679 --> 00:07:40,972
Thanks for inviting me along.

127
00:07:41,055 --> 00:07:44,976
-You've always…
-But you've been a real lifesaver for me.

128
00:07:45,685 --> 00:07:47,854
…known exactly
the right thing to say.

129
00:07:49,314 --> 00:07:51,566
You're always saving me.

130
00:07:54,611 --> 00:07:56,654
Huh? Yes!

131
00:07:56,738 --> 00:08:01,034
Mom just sent a ton of Momohiki pics!

132
00:08:01,117 --> 00:08:03,661
Mwah!

133
00:08:03,745 --> 00:08:05,914
Stop me if you hate this.

134
00:08:07,832 --> 00:08:08,833
Uh…

135
00:08:09,417 --> 00:08:11,085
Somewhere along the way,

136
00:08:11,169 --> 00:08:13,254
you became really important to me.

137
00:08:16,591 --> 00:08:17,425
Thank you.

138
00:08:20,595 --> 00:08:23,223
But of course!
What are friends for?

139
00:08:32,190 --> 00:08:34,025
I'm so thirsty.

140
00:08:34,817 --> 00:08:35,985
Didn't know you were up.

141
00:08:43,368 --> 00:08:45,870
Sorry, I interrupted!

142
00:08:45,954 --> 00:08:47,247
It's not like that!

143
00:08:48,122 --> 00:08:50,250
My little Anzu!

144
00:08:50,333 --> 00:08:53,586
I know you don't always act like it,
but you are a girl.

145
00:08:53,670 --> 00:08:56,130
You can't afford to have
a scar on your face.

146
00:08:56,214 --> 00:08:59,259
Now it's gonna be even harder for you
to attract your soulmate.

147
00:08:59,342 --> 00:09:00,718
Mom, stop it.

148
00:09:00,802 --> 00:09:02,470
There's no need
to worry about that.

149
00:09:02,554 --> 00:09:04,347
A true soulmate can see past your scars.

150
00:09:04,430 --> 00:09:07,642
Besides, she practically proposed
to Tsukasa already.

151
00:09:07,725 --> 00:09:08,560
Arisa!

152
00:09:09,060 --> 00:09:10,603
I will always be at his side!

153
00:09:10,687 --> 00:09:11,604
Ooh!

154
00:09:11,688 --> 00:09:13,898
You've got the wrong idea!
I didn't mean it like that!

155
00:09:14,774 --> 00:09:16,526
Speaking of boys, where's Junta?

156
00:09:16,609 --> 00:09:17,610
Baseball practice.

157
00:09:17,694 --> 00:09:20,780
I haven't seen him in a while.
I was looking forward to catching up.

158
00:09:20,863 --> 00:09:23,324
Well, speaking of catching up,
did Dad come too?

159
00:09:23,408 --> 00:09:26,619
Someone has to stay and take care
of Momohiki. He drew the short straw.

160
00:09:26,703 --> 00:09:28,121
You just left him, huh?

161
00:09:30,540 --> 00:09:33,084
I'm really curious.
How will they punish her?

162
00:09:33,751 --> 00:09:35,545
The authorities need to do something.

163
00:09:35,628 --> 00:09:38,715
This whole situation
has become such a nightmare.

164
00:09:39,340 --> 00:09:40,592
It's just so concerning

165
00:09:40,675 --> 00:09:44,220
because I know how persistent
that girl has always been in the past.

166
00:09:51,352 --> 00:09:53,730
What do you mean you can't cover
for her anymore?

167
00:09:53,813 --> 00:09:55,773
What are we supposed to do?

168
00:09:55,857 --> 00:09:58,276
I've said all I can about it.

169
00:09:58,359 --> 00:10:00,612
Wait! Hello?

170
00:10:03,698 --> 00:10:07,493
Again, I'm terribly sorry
for the trouble my niece has caused.

171
00:10:07,994 --> 00:10:08,911
It's fine.

172
00:10:09,495 --> 00:10:12,624
However, if she attempts
to hurt my friends again…

173
00:10:14,125 --> 00:10:15,877
Do we understand each other?

174
00:10:19,589 --> 00:10:21,049
Attaboy, Hijiri.

175
00:10:21,549 --> 00:10:24,594
Way to go, putting
those family connections to good use.

176
00:10:24,677 --> 00:10:26,179
I was counting on you.

177
00:10:27,263 --> 00:10:31,517
Unfortunately, I don't think
this punishment is gonna cut it.

178
00:10:39,525 --> 00:10:41,944
Separated from my love
once again.

179
00:10:43,071 --> 00:10:44,656
But do not fear, my sweet.

180
00:10:45,198 --> 00:10:47,533
We are destined to be together.

181
00:10:48,576 --> 00:10:51,454
I am the only one who can save you
from all those people,

182
00:10:52,038 --> 00:10:53,581
who want to keep us apart.

183
00:10:53,665 --> 00:10:55,458
Good evening.

184
00:10:55,541 --> 00:10:56,459
Huh?

185
00:10:57,210 --> 00:10:58,127
Who are you?

186
00:10:59,754 --> 00:11:02,965
Well, hey there! The name's Riri.
I'm a wizard.

187
00:11:03,549 --> 00:11:05,593
Sadly, my wand's been
out of order for a bit,

188
00:11:05,677 --> 00:11:08,137
and I haven't been able to use my magic.

189
00:11:08,888 --> 00:11:10,390
Are you crazy?

190
00:11:10,890 --> 00:11:14,268
That's funny.
I was gonna ask you the same thing.

191
00:11:25,405 --> 00:11:29,701
It's kinda strange. I haven't heard
a peep from Riri since the incident.

192
00:11:30,410 --> 00:11:31,786
At last!

193
00:11:31,869 --> 00:11:36,082
It's finally happening. You missed me.

194
00:11:36,165 --> 00:11:37,709
No! Did not!

195
00:11:38,251 --> 00:11:39,627
What do you want anyway?

196
00:11:39,711 --> 00:11:42,588
I know you called.
My Anzu senses were tingling.

197
00:11:45,842 --> 00:11:48,052
Oh, I get it.
You were hoping to get to see…

198
00:11:49,095 --> 00:11:50,388
this version of me, huh?

199
00:11:50,471 --> 00:11:52,056
I didn't call!

200
00:11:52,140 --> 00:11:53,683
And no matter what form you're in,

201
00:11:53,766 --> 00:11:55,685
you still look like
the world's biggest piece of crap!

202
00:11:55,768 --> 00:11:57,562
Such flowery language!

203
00:11:58,479 --> 00:12:01,691
I just came to tell you
you don't have anything to worry about.

204
00:12:02,358 --> 00:12:04,485
Your troubles have all vanished!

205
00:12:04,569 --> 00:12:06,738
Now you can just focus on being you.

206
00:12:07,572 --> 00:12:09,157
And don't ever change, okay?

207
00:12:11,325 --> 00:12:12,326
I love you.

208
00:12:16,789 --> 00:12:20,626
You bastard! Get over here!

209
00:12:21,586 --> 00:12:23,212
That was close! Here you go!

210
00:12:24,672 --> 00:12:27,592
Well, that was fun, but I gotta go!

211
00:12:28,468 --> 00:12:30,178
Goodbye, Anzu.

212
00:12:32,513 --> 00:12:35,391
Wait! What the heck was that about?

213
00:12:37,977 --> 00:12:40,062
What? She lost her memory?

214
00:12:41,063 --> 00:12:43,858
Yeah, at least
that's what her lawyer said.

215
00:12:44,400 --> 00:12:46,360
Kishi seems to have suffered
some sort of break,

216
00:12:46,444 --> 00:12:47,904
resulting in a loss of memory.

217
00:12:48,404 --> 00:12:50,448
She can't remember anything
from the past few years,

218
00:12:50,531 --> 00:12:51,657
including Tsukasa.

219
00:12:52,575 --> 00:12:54,827
Are they sure this girl isn't lying?

220
00:12:54,911 --> 00:12:56,996
The doctors seem to believe
it's the truth.

221
00:12:57,830 --> 00:12:59,957
Well, that's good news, then.
You should be relieved.

222
00:13:00,041 --> 00:13:02,460
You can finally go back
to living your life without fear.

223
00:13:03,169 --> 00:13:06,756
I guess. It's so sudden,
it doesn't feel real yet.

224
00:13:07,757 --> 00:13:09,592
Take all the time you need
to process it.

225
00:13:09,675 --> 00:13:10,676
Huh?

226
00:13:14,472 --> 00:13:15,389
Yeah.

227
00:13:17,225 --> 00:13:19,227
Anzu!

228
00:13:19,310 --> 00:13:21,020
-Dad! You're here!
-Ah! You're here!

229
00:13:21,729 --> 00:13:23,981
I was worried about you,
I couldn't stay away

230
00:13:24,065 --> 00:13:26,234
while I knew my little girl
was going through such a rough time.

231
00:13:26,317 --> 00:13:29,111
Plus, check out all these sweet gifts
I brought back

232
00:13:29,195 --> 00:13:31,364
just for you to help cheer you up!

233
00:13:31,447 --> 00:13:33,324
Games and chocolate!

234
00:13:35,326 --> 00:13:37,787
And don't forget the special pork buns.

235
00:13:37,870 --> 00:13:41,332
Pork buns? Hold on,
weren't they relocated to the US?

236
00:13:41,415 --> 00:13:43,543
And last but not least…

237
00:13:43,626 --> 00:13:45,211
Momohiki!

238
00:13:45,294 --> 00:13:48,089
Momohiki! Momohiki! Momohiki!

239
00:13:48,172 --> 00:13:51,342
Missed you so much!

240
00:13:51,926 --> 00:13:54,762
Hey.
Games, chocolate, and my Momohiki?

241
00:13:54,846 --> 00:13:58,391
My three greatest desires,
all suddenly back at once?

242
00:13:58,474 --> 00:14:00,309
What the heck does this mean?

243
00:14:05,106 --> 00:14:07,149
Don't you wanna sleep
in the office with Dad?

244
00:14:07,900 --> 00:14:10,194
He snores so loudly after traveling.

245
00:14:10,278 --> 00:14:11,612
Oh.

246
00:14:17,076 --> 00:14:19,036
Maybe I should just go home.

247
00:14:19,912 --> 00:14:21,998
Why? Her mom said you could stay, right?

248
00:14:22,081 --> 00:14:24,417
Yeah, but I don't wanna sleep
in the same room as you.

249
00:14:24,500 --> 00:14:26,168
Wow, way to sugarcoat it.

250
00:14:27,837 --> 00:14:29,547
-Hey.
-Huh?

251
00:14:30,923 --> 00:14:33,551
I have to be honest
with you about something.

252
00:14:35,261 --> 00:14:39,056
You know, uh, how I said before
that I didn't like Anzu in that way.

253
00:14:40,057 --> 00:14:41,350
Well, things have changed.

254
00:14:42,518 --> 00:14:44,437
What I'm trying to say--

255
00:14:44,520 --> 00:14:46,063
I know, all right?

256
00:14:46,647 --> 00:14:47,648
What?

257
00:14:47,732 --> 00:14:50,067
Anzu's always been
one of the coolest people I know,

258
00:14:50,151 --> 00:14:51,986
so I can see how you'd fall for her.

259
00:14:52,486 --> 00:14:54,322
So, you're okay with it?

260
00:14:54,989 --> 00:14:58,159
Oh, wait! That means that…

261
00:14:58,242 --> 00:15:00,536
…now I have to worry
about competing with you.

262
00:15:01,120 --> 00:15:03,623
Not only that, but Ryuya as well.

263
00:15:03,706 --> 00:15:06,626
Man, you do really have
low self-esteem, don't you?

264
00:15:08,419 --> 00:15:10,004
You shouldn't worry too much.

265
00:15:10,588 --> 00:15:13,049
I only just started feeling comfortable
around her.

266
00:15:13,633 --> 00:15:15,760
Plus, she only thinks of me as a friend.

267
00:15:16,260 --> 00:15:17,136
Huh?

268
00:15:18,137 --> 00:15:20,139
What? Pretty sure
you're in the friend zone too.

269
00:15:20,222 --> 00:15:22,391
Hey! You don't have to rub it in!

270
00:15:22,975 --> 00:15:26,270
Whatever. I only told you
'cause we're housemates.

271
00:15:26,938 --> 00:15:28,856
Feels weird sharing this kind of stuff.

272
00:15:29,482 --> 00:15:31,484
Let's never talk about it again.

273
00:15:31,567 --> 00:15:32,902
It's fine by me.

274
00:15:35,738 --> 00:15:36,906
Hmm.

275
00:15:36,989 --> 00:15:40,618
I'm not sleepy at all,
so I'm just gonna go downstairs.

276
00:15:40,701 --> 00:15:42,954
I'm not tired.
I think I'll go downstairs too.

277
00:15:43,037 --> 00:15:45,373
Huh? No way. How is that fair?

278
00:15:45,456 --> 00:15:46,958
Wait up, I'm coming too.

279
00:15:47,959 --> 00:15:50,252
You've got practice
in the morning, remember?

280
00:15:50,336 --> 00:15:52,713
There's no way
I'm leaving the two of you alone.

281
00:15:53,297 --> 00:15:55,424
I still cry just thinking
about the last time

282
00:15:55,508 --> 00:15:57,802
when you got to hug her!

283
00:15:57,885 --> 00:15:59,720
Pull yourself together.

284
00:16:02,807 --> 00:16:05,601
Riri, explain yourself!

285
00:16:06,102 --> 00:16:07,436
Get out here, right now!

286
00:16:09,522 --> 00:16:12,149
-I'm afraid that Riri's not coming.
-What?

287
00:16:15,236 --> 00:16:17,196
And, you are…

288
00:16:18,239 --> 00:16:20,282
Sorry to show up out of the blue.

289
00:16:20,366 --> 00:16:22,451
My name's Kate and I'm a wizard.

290
00:16:22,535 --> 00:16:24,870
I'm sort of the new wizard in charge.

291
00:16:24,954 --> 00:16:26,872
New wizard in charge?

292
00:16:27,915 --> 00:16:31,877
'Fraid so, since Riri's not allowed
in the human world.

293
00:16:32,878 --> 00:16:34,088
They're not?

294
00:16:34,171 --> 00:16:35,214
-Anzu?
-Huh?

295
00:16:35,297 --> 00:16:36,298
Uh?

296
00:16:36,382 --> 00:16:37,967
What's that?

297
00:16:38,050 --> 00:16:40,469
What's with the floating doll?

298
00:16:41,053 --> 00:16:43,931
Wait, can you guys see that thing too?

299
00:16:44,432 --> 00:16:45,599
Mm-hm.

300
00:16:46,475 --> 00:16:49,395
-What is this, furball?
-My name's Kate.

301
00:16:49,478 --> 00:16:52,523
I don't care what your name is!
Your magic's busted, fix it!

302
00:16:52,606 --> 00:16:56,402
Not again! I blew it!
I forgot to use an illusion spell!

303
00:16:56,485 --> 00:16:58,320
You're useless, you know that!

304
00:16:58,404 --> 00:17:00,740
Cut me a little slack, will ya?

305
00:17:00,823 --> 00:17:03,200
This whole day has been
pretty hectic for me too!

306
00:17:03,284 --> 00:17:04,744
-It's talking…
-It's talking…

307
00:17:07,163 --> 00:17:10,249
I don't know.
That story's pretty far-fetched,

308
00:17:10,332 --> 00:17:13,085
even with the wizard
sitting right there in front of me.

309
00:17:13,586 --> 00:17:17,214
Although when I think about it,
it actually explains a lot.

310
00:17:17,298 --> 00:17:18,132
PIERCING BRANCH

311
00:17:19,425 --> 00:17:20,718
SOAKING-WET ROOM

312
00:17:21,594 --> 00:17:25,931
So, then, our reunion
was sped up to fit its timeline?

313
00:17:26,432 --> 00:17:29,727
Man, how did I not notice
something like that?

314
00:17:30,478 --> 00:17:34,315
I'm really sorry, you guys. I didn't mean
for you to get mixed up in this.

315
00:17:34,398 --> 00:17:38,277
It's so embarrassing to be
subject number one for this stupid thing.

316
00:17:38,778 --> 00:17:40,988
You've got nothing to apologize for.

317
00:17:41,781 --> 00:17:43,783
I'm sure this has been hardest on you.

318
00:17:44,408 --> 00:17:47,411
Besides, meeting you is what saved me.

319
00:17:47,912 --> 00:17:49,497
So please don't apologize.

320
00:17:49,580 --> 00:17:51,165
I feel the same.

321
00:17:51,665 --> 00:17:54,126
I don't care how.
I'm just glad we're reunited.

322
00:17:54,627 --> 00:17:57,254
Junta, Kazuki.

323
00:17:59,215 --> 00:18:03,302
Though, I really don't like
the idea of a forced romance.

324
00:18:03,385 --> 00:18:07,223
Don't blame me. Both Riri and I
are just cogs in the corporate machine,

325
00:18:07,306 --> 00:18:08,224
just following orders.

326
00:18:08,307 --> 00:18:10,017
Hang on.

327
00:18:10,101 --> 00:18:12,895
What do you mean,
they can't come back to this world?

328
00:18:12,978 --> 00:18:16,565
Riri broke the rules and used taboo magic.

329
00:18:16,649 --> 00:18:17,566
Taboo?

330
00:18:17,650 --> 00:18:20,569
'Fraid so. They use
their magic to erase the memories

331
00:18:20,653 --> 00:18:23,656
of Kazuki's stalker
for their own personal reasons.

332
00:18:24,198 --> 00:18:25,950
But why? Why'd they do that?

333
00:18:27,493 --> 00:18:31,455
Anzu's fault! The higher-ups thought
Riri developed feelings for Anzu

334
00:18:31,539 --> 00:18:33,207
that went beyond the professional bounds.

335
00:18:34,083 --> 00:18:37,169
Remember when you were
attacked by those two men in the alley?

336
00:18:37,253 --> 00:18:38,963
All of your friends
just randomly showed up.

337
00:18:39,547 --> 00:18:42,716
Right, everyone arrived
after receiving those texts.

338
00:18:44,009 --> 00:18:46,262
That interference was Riri's first strike.

339
00:18:46,345 --> 00:18:47,847
They really crossed the line.

340
00:18:47,930 --> 00:18:50,975
You see, we have very strict rules
about using our magic.

341
00:18:51,058 --> 00:18:54,562
It must be used only for the development
of romantic relationships.

342
00:18:56,147 --> 00:18:58,399
So, what's going to happen to Riri?

343
00:18:58,899 --> 00:19:01,110
Capital punishment
of the magic world.

344
00:19:01,193 --> 00:19:02,486
What?

345
00:19:03,195 --> 00:19:06,157
It's usually what would happen,
but not this time.

346
00:19:06,240 --> 00:19:07,408
The company was lenient,

347
00:19:07,491 --> 00:19:10,661
and instead, settled for a life sentence
of cleaning the basement.

348
00:19:11,412 --> 00:19:12,830
Life sentence?

349
00:19:12,913 --> 00:19:16,917
I see. So they didn't want anyone
to know about Riri's actions.

350
00:19:17,001 --> 00:19:18,002
Avoid the scandal.

351
00:19:18,085 --> 00:19:20,921
Of course.
The company has a reputation to maintain.

352
00:19:21,005 --> 00:19:22,631
They'd agree on almost anything.

353
00:19:22,715 --> 00:19:25,050
That's how Riri was able
to negotiate getting you back

354
00:19:25,134 --> 00:19:27,261
your three greatest desires
as part of their deal.

355
00:19:27,344 --> 00:19:28,512
Any more questions?

356
00:19:29,013 --> 00:19:32,558
Nope, I think I understand
everything. Thanks for the insight, Kate.

357
00:19:33,142 --> 00:19:35,561
Of course. I look forward
to working with you--

358
00:19:45,988 --> 00:19:47,156
Hey, wait! Oh…

359
00:19:47,740 --> 00:19:51,744
What do you think you're doing?
Give me back my wand!

360
00:19:52,244 --> 00:19:55,039
You're gonna let me see Riri right now.

361
00:19:55,122 --> 00:19:56,540
If I remember correctly,

362
00:19:56,624 --> 00:19:59,585
you can't use your magic
if your wand is contaminated.

363
00:20:00,211 --> 00:20:01,378
You wouldn't…

364
00:20:01,462 --> 00:20:04,048
Imagine the trouble you'll be in
when your bosses find out

365
00:20:04,131 --> 00:20:06,634
that on your first day,
you exposed yourself to humans,

366
00:20:06,717 --> 00:20:08,886
and reveal the details
of your secret mission.

367
00:20:09,470 --> 00:20:12,139
Add to that, wand contamination.

368
00:20:12,723 --> 00:20:15,434
And just so you know,
my dad's been in here tonight,

369
00:20:15,517 --> 00:20:17,895
and it wasn't pretty!

370
00:20:23,484 --> 00:20:25,903
Your little stunt cost me my bonus.

371
00:20:25,986 --> 00:20:28,989
My bosses agreed to 15 minutes
with Riri now.

372
00:20:29,657 --> 00:20:31,659
That's what I'm talking about.

373
00:20:31,742 --> 00:20:34,453
Yeah, no kidding.
That's how you play hardball.

374
00:20:35,663 --> 00:20:37,498
Stand back. I'm gonna summon Riri.

375
00:20:37,581 --> 00:20:41,460
Go! Roma-roma! Kira-kira!

376
00:20:48,467 --> 00:20:50,469
Kate! Do you have to be so rough?

377
00:20:50,552 --> 00:20:52,263
Sorry.

378
00:20:52,346 --> 00:20:54,556
Riri.

379
00:20:55,140 --> 00:20:56,475
Anzu!

380
00:20:56,558 --> 00:20:58,644
Could you transform for me?

381
00:21:01,730 --> 00:21:03,816
What, what is it?

382
00:21:05,859 --> 00:21:08,570
That's much better.

383
00:21:10,114 --> 00:21:14,493
-How dare you disappear on me like that?
-Stop, stop!

384
00:21:14,576 --> 00:21:16,537
Let go!

385
00:21:18,163 --> 00:21:21,667
You may not like it,
but everything Kate told you is true.

386
00:21:22,543 --> 00:21:26,839
This is goodbye forever. After this,
I'll never be allowed to see you again.

387
00:21:26,922 --> 00:21:31,343
But hey, you'll be fine. I mean,
I was only in your way, right, Anzu?

388
00:21:32,136 --> 00:21:33,304
So…

389
00:21:34,388 --> 00:21:35,472
Thank you.

390
00:21:38,309 --> 00:21:41,645
Seriously, you left
before I could say it, moron.

391
00:21:42,813 --> 00:21:46,442
I'm sure an ordinary heroine
would have said that with more poise.

392
00:21:48,193 --> 00:21:51,196
Too bad for you,
I'll always be an Anti-Heroine.

393
00:21:52,364 --> 00:21:54,533
You know,
she's not the only one.

394
00:21:55,117 --> 00:21:56,327
Thank you, Rio.

395
00:21:57,828 --> 00:22:00,080
Kazuki, no. You and Anzu,

396
00:22:01,206 --> 00:22:04,376
you guys shouldn't thank me for anything.

397
00:22:04,877 --> 00:22:06,253
I messed up.

398
00:22:06,962 --> 00:22:09,256
I broke the rules and ruined everything.

399
00:22:10,799 --> 00:22:13,385
And now that you've got
your three greatest desires back,

400
00:22:13,927 --> 00:22:16,722
you can just forget about me,
like a bad dream.

401
00:22:17,473 --> 00:22:18,599
Are you dense?

402
00:22:19,975 --> 00:22:23,896
That's nuts! Do you really think
I'd choose things over my friends?

403
00:22:24,480 --> 00:22:26,774
Never! I would never forget about you.

404
00:22:26,857 --> 00:22:28,400
So what is it you want?

405
00:22:28,901 --> 00:22:29,860
Huh?

406
00:22:30,361 --> 00:22:33,364
I'm asking you, Riri,
what do you want to do?

407
00:22:33,989 --> 00:22:34,865
Uh…

408
00:22:36,784 --> 00:22:38,619
Anzu, what I want…

409
00:22:40,746 --> 00:22:41,789
…is to be…

410
00:22:42,748 --> 00:22:44,083
here by your side!

411
00:22:47,086 --> 00:22:49,630
Then stay with me. It's that easy.

412
00:22:52,466 --> 00:22:53,384
Okay.

413
00:22:55,928 --> 00:22:59,765
Oh, Anzu!

414
00:23:02,101 --> 00:23:05,104
So, hey, um,
are you guys almost done here?

415
00:23:05,187 --> 00:23:07,189
'Cause we really need to wrap this up.

416
00:23:07,898 --> 00:23:10,192
Hey, Furball! Read the room!

417
00:23:10,275 --> 00:23:12,778
I told you I'm Kate, not Furball!

418
00:23:12,861 --> 00:23:14,196
Whatever!

419
00:23:14,279 --> 00:23:19,284
Besides, Riri's not going anywhere.
Use your magic so they can stay for good.

420
00:23:19,785 --> 00:23:22,955
I can't do that!
Like I said, magic can only be used…

421
00:23:23,038 --> 00:23:26,291
…if it contributes
to any romantic relationships!

422
00:23:26,792 --> 00:23:28,836
That's right. Finally, she gets it.

423
00:23:28,919 --> 00:23:30,003
Well.

424
00:23:30,546 --> 00:23:34,508
What if I told you there's
a 0.00001 percent chance

425
00:23:34,591 --> 00:23:37,302
that I'd fall for Rio,
making him my potential mate?

426
00:23:38,095 --> 00:23:41,223
Rio? Wait! Oh…

427
00:23:41,807 --> 00:23:43,308
Anzu?

428
00:23:44,935 --> 00:23:47,896
As the wizard in charge,
you're making sure that I fall in love.

429
00:23:47,980 --> 00:23:50,232
You can't separate me
from a potential mate.

430
00:23:50,315 --> 00:23:52,526
That'll break some rules, right?

431
00:23:53,110 --> 00:23:55,362
Therefore…

432
00:23:56,363 --> 00:24:01,410
It's completely and totally legal for you
to use your magic to keep Rio here!

433
00:24:01,493 --> 00:24:02,828
-Wow.
-Whoa.

434
00:24:03,328 --> 00:24:04,913
What?

435
00:24:04,997 --> 00:24:06,415
Okay, fine then.

436
00:24:06,498 --> 00:24:10,127
This is bad. I'm gonna get
such a pay cut for this.

437
00:24:11,295 --> 00:24:13,672
You really are the queen of debate!

438
00:24:14,173 --> 00:24:17,009
Huh. Don't go getting
the wrong idea or anything.

439
00:24:17,092 --> 00:24:20,471
I'm not cooperating with your project
and I'm not losing this game.

440
00:24:22,097 --> 00:24:23,849
Neither am I.

441
00:24:24,349 --> 00:24:26,435
I won't lose! Bring it on!

442
00:24:28,604 --> 00:24:32,232
Once things calmed down,
my parents left again to go back to work.

443
00:24:33,817 --> 00:24:36,737
I'm sleepy.

444
00:24:36,820 --> 00:24:39,239
I was up way too late playing games.

445
00:24:39,323 --> 00:24:42,117
And the three of us
continued living together.

446
00:24:43,035 --> 00:24:45,913
The boss was nearly impossible to beat.

447
00:24:45,996 --> 00:24:47,247
Don't fall asleep. You'll trip.

448
00:24:47,831 --> 00:24:48,749
Yeah, yeah.

449
00:24:48,832 --> 00:24:51,126
Leave it to Anzu
to sleepwalk to school.

450
00:24:52,461 --> 00:24:53,587
Huh?

451
00:24:54,505 --> 00:24:56,673
Good morning, my fellow students.

452
00:24:57,674 --> 00:24:59,510
The new semester begins.

453
00:24:59,593 --> 00:25:03,096
It must be a treat for you three
to get to be in my presence daily.

454
00:25:03,180 --> 00:25:04,014
Huh?

455
00:25:04,681 --> 00:25:08,060
We're just so grateful. You're a delight.

456
00:25:08,143 --> 00:25:10,771
By the way,
thanks for pulling some strings.

457
00:25:10,854 --> 00:25:13,190
-Now Kishi's family will stop--
-Who told you that?

458
00:25:13,273 --> 00:25:14,107
Tsuchiya.

459
00:25:14,608 --> 00:25:16,527
Mm-mm. Mm-mm. Mm-mm. Mm-mm…

460
00:25:17,110 --> 00:25:19,780
It's admirable to do
such a good deed without showing off.

461
00:25:19,863 --> 00:25:23,116
I-- I don't care
what you plebs think of me.

462
00:25:23,200 --> 00:25:25,035
Again with this hot and cold act?

463
00:25:31,208 --> 00:25:33,835
I don't know
if I've said this before, but,

464
00:25:33,919 --> 00:25:37,464
I really appreciate our time together
on these walks to school.

465
00:25:37,548 --> 00:25:38,632
What?

466
00:25:38,715 --> 00:25:40,717
Uh, wait, did that sound weird?

467
00:25:41,218 --> 00:25:43,136
Not at all. It's very sweet.

468
00:25:43,220 --> 00:25:46,223
Could he be any more obvious?

469
00:25:47,224 --> 00:25:50,519
I suppose I don't have
to actively avoid romance anymore,

470
00:25:50,602 --> 00:25:53,689
since I did get
all of my things back, right?

471
00:25:53,772 --> 00:25:56,108
-Good morning!
-Huh?

472
00:25:56,650 --> 00:25:58,902
What? She's back?

473
00:26:02,281 --> 00:26:04,074
I'm here to tell you about the new rules.

474
00:26:04,575 --> 00:26:06,076
The new rules?

475
00:26:06,660 --> 00:26:11,039
Yep! You see, your games, chocolate,
and cat may have been returned for now,

476
00:26:11,623 --> 00:26:14,751
but, unless you start prioritizing
romantic relationships,

477
00:26:15,252 --> 00:26:17,504
you'll lose them all again!

478
00:26:17,588 --> 00:26:20,924
Not fair! It's like facing the final boss
with level one weapon.

479
00:26:21,008 --> 00:26:22,050
That's bad, right?

480
00:26:22,134 --> 00:26:23,802
And if you finish high school

481
00:26:23,885 --> 00:26:25,512
and you're still alone,

482
00:26:25,596 --> 00:26:28,515
well, then they'll be confiscated forever!

483
00:26:28,599 --> 00:26:30,475
What?

484
00:26:31,184 --> 00:26:34,813
I told you before,
I will not be forced into a relationship!

485
00:26:35,314 --> 00:26:38,817
You'll see! I will not lose,
I'll win this project!

486
00:26:38,900 --> 00:26:41,945
Ah! Anzu, you're so bold, I love it!

487
00:26:42,571 --> 00:26:44,114
And let's not forget, you two,

488
00:26:44,197 --> 00:26:47,284
that there's still a possibility
that Anzu ends up with me!

489
00:26:47,367 --> 00:26:49,953
So, don't take it personally, okay?

490
00:26:50,037 --> 00:26:52,331
You've done good but my kiss
is hard to compete with,

491
00:26:52,414 --> 00:26:53,749
plus we've already kissed twice.

492
00:26:53,832 --> 00:26:55,834
Do something about your mouth,

493
00:26:55,917 --> 00:26:57,044
or I will.

494
00:26:57,127 --> 00:27:00,672
Oh! Right here in front of everyone?
Are you sure?

495
00:27:00,756 --> 00:27:03,175
Knock it off! You know what I mean!

496
00:27:03,258 --> 00:27:05,093
You're blushing!
Are you embarrassed?

497
00:27:05,177 --> 00:27:06,553
I'm not blushing!

498
00:27:07,471 --> 00:27:10,390
MEDICAL CENTER

499
00:27:10,474 --> 00:27:13,393
My next subject
should be around here somewhere.

500
00:27:14,394 --> 00:27:15,979
Oh, there she is.

501
00:27:17,022 --> 00:27:19,775
Hopefully
she's not as difficult to work with.

502
00:27:52,766 --> 00:27:56,937
Anzu's wonderful
and oh, so romantic developments

503
00:27:57,020 --> 00:28:00,982
are slowly progressing as we speak.

